    "text": "To solve the problem, we need to use the given operation definition \\( K \\star L = (K + L)(K - L) \\). We are asked to find the value of \\( 6 \\star 5 \\).\n\nLet's break down the steps:\n\n1. **Identify the values of \\( K \\) and \\( L \\):**\n   \\[\n   K = 6, \\quad L = 5\n   \\]\n\n2. **Apply the operation definition \\( K \\star L = (K + L)(K - L) \\):**\n   \\[\n   6 \\star 5 = (6 + 5)(6 - 5)\n   \\]\n\n3. **Calculate \\( K + L \\):**\n   \\[\n   6 + 5 = 11\n   \\]\n\n4. **Calculate \\( K - L \\):**\n   \\[\n   6 - 5 = 1\n   \\]\n\n5. **Multiply the results from steps 3 and 4:**\n   \\[\n   (6 + 5)(6 - 5) = 11 \\times 1 = 11\n   \\]\n\nTherefore, the value of \\( 6 \\star 5 \\) is \\(\\boxed{11}\\).",
